  "mach:judgement": "Adopt",
  "mach:judgementReason": "Required alongside SDTM for FDA and EMA drug approval submissions — ADaM is the analysis layer that makes SDTM trial data machine-auditable and reproducible. Any team building statistical analysis pipelines, AI-assisted trial analytics, or regulatory-grade reporting tools must understand ADaM structure. The pair SDTM + ADaM defines the complete data lifecycle for regulated clinical trials.",
